<!-- ================= FAQ ================= -->\
<section class="sec-pad" id="faq" style="background:var(--gray-100);">\
  <div class="container">\
    <div class="sec-head reveal">\
      <span class="eyebrow">Tez-tez Veril\uc0\u601 n Suallar</span>\
      <h2>Bilm\uc0\u601 k ist\u601 dikl\u601 riniz</h2>\
      <p>\uc0\u399 lav\u601  sual\u305 n\u305 z varsa, birba\u351 a biziml\u601  \u601 laq\u601  saxlaya bil\u601 rsiniz.</p>\
    </div>\
\
    <div class="faq-list reveal">\
      <details class="faq-item">\
        <summary>Xidm\uc0\u601 tl\u601 riniz namiz\u601 dl\u601 r \'fc\'e7\'fcn \'f6d\u601 ni\u351 lidirmi?</summary>\
        <p>M\'fcraci\uc0\u601 t v\u601  ilkin qiym\u601 tl\u601 ndirm\u601  pulsuzdur. Xidm\u601 t \u351 \u601 rtl\u601 ri h\u601 r bir vakansiya \'fczr\u601  f\u601 rdi olaraq, r\u601 smi m\'fcqavil\u601  \'e7\u601 r\'e7iv\u601 sind\u601 , \'f6nc\u601 d\u601 n \u351 \u601 ffaf \u351 \u601 kild\u601  izah olunur.</p>\
      </details>\
      <details class="faq-item">\
        <summary>Yaln\uc0\u305 z TIR s\'fcr\'fcc\'fcl\u601 ri \'fc\'e7\'fcn vakansiyan\u305 z var?</summary>\
        <p>Xeyr. TIR s\'fcr\'fcc\'fcl\'fcy\'fcnd\uc0\u601 n \u601 lav\u601 , t\u601 r\u601 fda\u351  i\u351 \u601 g\'f6t\'fcr\u601 nl\u601 rimizl\u601  \u601 m\u601 kda\u351 l\u305 q \'e7\u601 r\'e7iv\u601 sind\u601  tikinti, istehsalat v\u601  xidm\u601 t sah\u601 l\u601 ri \'fczr\u601  d\u601  vakansiyalar t\u601 qdim edirik. Siyah\u305  m\'fct\u601 madi yenil\u601 nir.</p>\
      </details>\
      <details class="faq-item">\
        <summary>Rus dili bilmir\uc0\u601 ms\u601  m\'fcraci\u601 t ed\u601  bil\u601 r\u601 mmi?</summary>\
        <p>Pol\uc0\u351 adak\u305  TIR s\'fcr\'fcc\'fcs\'fc vakansiyas\u305  \'fc\'e7\'fcn minimum A1\'96A2 s\u601 viyy\u601 sind\u601  rus dili (\'fcnsiyy\u601 t s\u601 viyy\u601 sind\u601 ) t\u601 l\u601 b olunur. Dig\u601 r vakansiyalar \'fc\'e7\'fcn dil t\u601 l\u601 bi m\'f6vq\u601 d\u601 n as\u305 l\u305  olaraq d\u601 yi\u351 \u601  bil\u601 r \'97 d\u601 qiq m\u601 lumat\u305  m\'fcraci\u601 t zaman\u305  \u601 ld\u601  ed\u601  bil\u601 rsiniz.</p>\
      </details>\
      <details class="faq-item">\
        <summary>Viza prosesi n\uc0\u601  q\u601 d\u601 r \'e7\u601 kir v\u601  kim \'f6d\u601 yir?</summary>\
        <p>Viza m\'fcdd\uc0\u601 ti \'f6lk\u601  v\u601  vakansiyadan as\u305 l\u305  olaraq d\u601 yi\u351 ir. Proses tam olaraq bizim t\u601 r\u601 fimizd\u601 n m\'fc\u351 ayi\u601 t olunur; \u351 \u601 rtl\u601 r m\'fcqavil\u601 d\u601  \u601 vv\u601 lc\u601 d\u601 n ayd\u305 n \u351 \u601 kild\u601  g\'f6st\u601 rilir.</p>\
      </details>\
      <details class="faq-item">\
        <summary>Ya\uc0\u351 ay\u305 \u351  yerini kim t\u601 min edir?</summary>\
        <p>Pol\uc0\u351 adak\u305  TIR s\'fcr\'fcc\'fcs\'fc vakansiyas\u305  \'fczr\u601  ya\u351 ay\u305 \u351  yeri i\u351 \u601 g\'f6t\'fcr\u601 n t\u601 r\u601 find\u601 n t\u601 min olunur. Dig\u601 r vakansiyalar \'fc\'e7\'fcn \u351 \u601 rtl\u601 r m\'f6vq\u601 d\u601 n as\u305 l\u305  olaraq f\u601 rql\u601 n\u601  bil\u601 r.</p>\
      </details>\
      <details class="faq-item">\
        <summary>\uc0\u350 irk\u601 tiniz r\u601 smi f\u601 aliyy\u601 t g\'f6st\u601 rir?</summary>\
        <p>B\uc0\u601 li. Euro Career, Az\u601 rbaycan Respublikas\u305 n\u305 n \u601 m\u601 k miqrasiyas\u305  sah\u601 sind\u601 ki qanunvericiliyinin t\u601 l\u601 bl\u601 rin\u601  uy\u287 un, r\u601 smi qeydiyyatdan ke\'e7mi\u351  h\'fcquqi \u351 \u601 xs kimi f\u601 aliyy\u601 t g\'f6st\u601 rir. B\'fct\'fcn namiz\u601 dl\u601 rl\u601  yaz\u305 l\u305 , \u351 \u601 ffaf m\'fcqavil\u601  \u601 sas\u305 nda i\u351 l\u601 yirik.</p>\
      </details>\
    </div>\
  </div>\
</section>\
